  "releaseNotes": "10.2.0: BREAKING: no longer depends on Jakar.Extensions (Jakar.Files, Jakar.Core, Jakar.Logging, Jakar.Collections instead). Gains PasswordValidator, PasswordRequirements, Regexes, UnitConverters, Email, IUserName, IValidator, IAppName, ICurrentLocation/AltitudeReference/DistanceUnit and SupportedLanguage. IWebAppSettings moved to Jakar.Extensions; JwtParser.GetOrCreateParser/CreateAsync take (IConfiguration, appName, version, authenticationType) (Jakar.Extensions adds the IWebAppSettings overloads). 10.1.0: initial release. Split out of Jakar.Extensions 10.12.0; the types keep the Jakar.Extensions namespace.",
